{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27290","headline":"日暖万年枝 · 蒋防","name":"日暖万年枝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新阳归上苑，嘉树独含妍。\n散漫添和气，曈曨卷曙烟。\n流辉宜圣日，接影贵芳年。\n自与恩光近，那关煦妪偏。\n结根诚得地，表寿愿符天。\n谁道凌寒质，从兹不暧然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蒋防","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}